&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt;The Senior Sales Director is a recognized subject-matter expert on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt;Pacvue&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt; platform and the enterprise commerce landscape, responsible for leading strategic new business and deepening relationships with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt;Pacvue&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt; largest global clients. This senior individual contributor role is built for a highly motivated, consultative seller who leads on the most significant and unique enterprise sales challenges — often involving unprecedented deal structures or first-of-their-kind partnerships. The Senior Sales Director shapes how the broader sales org positions &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt;Pacvue&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8343163 BCX8&quot;&gt; platform to top-tier accounts and sets the strategic direction for winning in the rapidly evolving commerce landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Serve as the internal subject-matter expert on Pacvue&#39;s platform and the enterprise commerce landscape, shaping how the broader sales org positions the product to top-tier accounts and prospects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Independently define and evolve the enterprise sales approach for top-tier global accounts — from identification of account, to identification of correct contact, continued nurturing, demo, and closing — setting precedent that other team members follow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Exercise independent judgment on strategic account decisions that influence revenue outcomes and go-to-market approach across the entire sales function, including retaining and growing revenue from Pacvue&#39;s largest existing global advertisers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead on the most significant and unique enterprise sales challenges, often involving complex, high-stakes deal structures across practitioner to executive-level audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build formal relationships across product, marketing, and executive leadership to advance strategic deals, and mentor or direct other sales team members on enterprise deal strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Utilize Sales CRM tools to track account information and sales progress, forecasting and prioritizing in ways that inform broader team strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Maintain deep, evolving expertise in the e-commerce industry and competitive landscape, including competitive product offerings, to inform Pacvue&#39;s positioning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Typically 12+ years of B2B and/or SaaS sales experience, including a track record of leading enterprise strategy for the largest, most strategic accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Deep experience with sales CRM and prospecting tools such as Hubspot, Salesforce, Outreach.io or like programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
