&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;is the leading Commerce Media OS, powering over $12B in advertising spend across 100+ global retail media networks including Amazon, Walmart, Target, Kroger, Instacart, Criteo, and&amp;nbsp;CitrusAd. Powered by industry-leading AI and real-time data,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;enables over 70,000 brands and agencies to maximize advertising performance, drive incrementality, and expand reach across the commerce universe from a single mission control. As of 2025,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;powers 12% of total retail media ad spend worldwide excluding China. Combined with Helium 10’s SMB solutions,&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;delivers the industry’s most comprehensive platform for businesses of all sizes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;Pacvue&amp;nbsp;and Helium 10, great careers&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;just happen —&amp;nbsp;they’re&amp;nbsp;built. Here,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;rise as an industry leader, push the boundaries of innovation, own your journey, and thrive as part of an inclusive global community&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;redefining the future of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the&amp;nbsp;Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a client-facing role. The Business Solutions Partner spends the majority of their time working directly with clients — helping them unlock value from Pacvue’s platform, identifying the right solutions to their business challenges, and translating field insights into structured product feedback. It is a role for someone who is comfortable in front of customers, curious about technology, and motivated to sit at the intersection of commercial and product thinking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The BSP brings deep knowledge about all Pacvue platforms and services to support client engagements and drive measurable product improvements. The role is designed to flex across the full client lifecycle as business needs evolve, working in close collaboration with the broader BSP team and cross-functional partners across Sales, Product, and Customer Success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Technical Solutioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client engagement is the primary focus of this role. The BSP is the technical face of Pacvue in client interactions, helping clients and internal teams identify the right parts of the platform and product suite to address real business challenges — including scoping custom approaches for more complex needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work directly with clients to understand their objectives, identify gaps, and recommend solutions across Pacvue’s platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales, Account Management, Customer Success, and agency teams to support high-value engagements and post-sales technical guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Communicate platform capabilities clearly to a range of audiences — from hands-on practitioners to senior decision-makers — in person and virtually. Regular travel to client sites, industry events, and team meetings across EMEA is a key component of this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support opportunities across the full funnel — from pre-sales discovery through to expansion — contributing technical depth where it is needed most.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Identify and support upsell and cross-sell opportunities through a strong understanding of client needs and platform capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Product Feedback &amp;amp; Roadmap Contribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The BSP is among the closest team members to the client, and this perspective is central to the role. Structured, actionable product feedback is a core deliverable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Collect and structure product feedback from client interactions, working closely with the BSP team to build a consolidated, prioritised view of client needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Translate real client use cases into clear product requirements, collaborating with BSP colleagues and Product teams to make feedback actionable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contribute to regular VOC reporting, covering themes across features, retailer integrations, UX, and data — linked to commercial opportunity where relevant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Participate in EMEA alpha/beta programmes, gathering feedback and helping close the loop between clients and product teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flag expansion opportunities linked to product gaps or unmet client needs, contributing to pipeline and account growth conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;GTM &amp;amp; Enablement Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support GTM initiatives and product launches — particularly in non-Amazon Retail Media, programmatic, and DSP — by sharing client perspective and helping validate positioning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contribute to enablement sessions, playbooks, and solution guides for Sales and internal teams, with a focus on Retail Media (non-Amazon), programmatic, and DSP capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Help develop practical content — demos, ROI models, talking points — that supports the commercial team in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Share competitive and market observations to inform product and GTM strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate has a solid grounding in programmatic advertising, is confident and effective in client-facing environments, and has the structured thinking required to manage product feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with programmatic and DSP platforms; familiarity with Amazon DSP is a plus, and The Trade Desk experience is also valued.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A solid understanding of retail media and full-funnel advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Confidence in client-facing situations, with the ability to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and translate client needs into actionable recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Structured thinking and clear communication — the ability to connect client feedback to what a product team needs to understand and act on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience in brand media teams, ad tech, retail media, solutions consulting, agency, or a related commercial or operational environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel regularly across EMEA as part of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Pacvue is committed to employing a diverse workforce. Qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, or disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations: &lt;/strong&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Sr. Manager, Talent Acquisition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt; supporting Conga across EMEA, you&#39;ll manage end-to-end hiring for a broad range of functions, with a particular focus on Go-to-Market (Sales, Customer Success, Professional Services, Marketing, Revenue Operations, and related functions) and SaaS talent acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll serve as a trusted talent advisor to hiring managers and business leaders, partnering closely with stakeholders to define hiring strategies, identify top talent, and drive successful hiring outcomes. You&#39;ll combine strong recruiting execution with market expertise, stakeholder management, and a consultative approach to hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also help shape recruiting strategy, mentor team members where appropriate, improve recruiting processes, and elevate the candidate and hiring manager experience across multiple countries and functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why it’s a big deal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The quality and pace of hiring directly influence how Conga serves customers, develops products, supports colleagues, and grows across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Recruiter, you&#39;ll play a critical role in helping the business attract and hire exceptional talent while providing market insights, strategic guidance, and a high-touch recruiting experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruitment lifecycle, from intake and workforce planning discussions through sourcing, screening, interview management, selection, offer negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead recruitment efforts across Go-to-Market functions, including Sales, Customer Success, Revenue Operations, Marketing, Professional Services, and other strategic business areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders and hiring managers as a trusted advisor, influencing hiring strategies and talent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build role-specific sourcing strategies using LinkedIn Recruiter, talent communities, referrals, direct outreach, and other relevant channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain high-quality talent pipelines, including proactive engagement with passive candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage knowledge of SaaS talent markets to identify and attract top-performing candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular pipeline updates, market intelligence, talent trends, and hiring recommendations to stakeholders and Talent Acquisition leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver structured, respectful, and timely communication to candidates throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate effectively with People Partners, Finance, HR Operations, HRIS, compensation partners, and other stakeholders to support approvals and offers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Greenhouse and other recruiting tools accurately, maintaining complete and reliable candidate and requisition data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply inclusive hiring practices, help reduce bias, and support structured and equitable assessment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps and contribute practical improvements, templates, and scalable recruiting practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Conga’s employer brand consistently and professionally in every candidate and stakeholder interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and contribute to Talent Acquisition projects, process improvements, and best practices across the EMEA recruiting organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of full-cycle recruiting experience in a fast-paced, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success recruiting for Go-to-Market functions within a SaaS or high-growth technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience partnering with hiring managers and business leaders as a trusted advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success sourcing and engaging passive candidates through direct outreach and talent mapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and prioritization skills, with the ability to manage multiple searches and changing business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, professional communication skills and a candidate-first service mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using an applicant tracking system, ideally Greenhouse, and LinkedIn Recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of inclusive recruiting practices and structured interviewing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; additional European languages are an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will give you an edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting within SaaS organizations and supporting commercial Go-to-Market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting across multiple EMEA countries and navigating varied talent markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring for leadership and senior-level positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to high-growth, scaling technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, resourceful approach and a track record of improving recruiting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance detail with the broader business context and communicate confidently with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Did we pique your interest? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of job you would love in the kind of environment where you would thrive, please click apply. &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Resume Format&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We accept resumes in any format, we suggest using PDF or plain text. These formats help ensure that your resume’s formatting remains intact, making it easier for our recruiters to review your application promptly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t meet every requirement for the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and members of ethnic minorities are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single qualification. At Conga we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace, so if you’re excited about this role but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You just might be the right candidate for this or other roles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;st-additionalInformation&quot; class=&quot;job-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conga is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer and provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, age, national origin, disability, parental or pregnancy status, marriage and civil partnership, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. We understand interviewing can be stressful for those with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to allow you to show us your best self, please let your recruiter know as soon as possible. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines. Conga is not open to third party solicitation or resumes for our posted FTE positions. Resumes received from third party agencies that are unsolicited will be considered complimentary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;job-apply print-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&#39;s Applicant Privacy Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The information you provide during the application process will be used in accordance with Conga’s Applicant Privacy Statement (&lt;a href=&quot;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&quot;&gt;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&lt;/a&gt;). By submitting your application, you acknowledge and agree to the terms outlined in this privacy statement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure, Inc. provides innovative technologies for the treatment of Afib and related conditions. Afib affects more than 33 million people worldwide. Electrophysiologists and cardiothoracic surgeons around the globe use AtriCure technologies for the treatment of Afib and reduction of Afib related complications. AtriCure’s Isolator® Synergy™ Ablation System is the first medical device to receive FDA approval for the treatment of persistent Afib. AtriCure’s AtriClip® Left Atrial Appendage Exclusion System products are the most widely sold LAA management devices worldwide. AtriCure’s Hybrid AF™ Therapy is a minimally invasive procedure that provides a lasting solution for long-standing persistent Afib patients. AtriCure’s cryoICE cryoSPHERE® probe is cleared for temporary ablation of peripheral nerves to block pain, providing pain relief in cardiac and thoracic procedures. For more information, visit AtriCure.com or follow us on Twitter -----
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a culture of inclusion by embracing diverse experiences and individuals where everyone’s authentic self is welcome. We offer supporting programs and resources that provide enriching and equitable opportunities for each person to contribute professionally and personally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AtriCure Legal Affairs Team provides responsive, practical, solution-oriented legal support to all departments and entities within this global, US-headquartered company. The team manages a broad range of matters, including transactional work, employment, corporate governance, litigation, and strategic initiatives. Under the supervision of the Deputy General Counsel, the Associate General Counsel advises and supports internal, international clients; drafts and negotiates a broad range of agreements; handles and helps manage complex legal matters; leads cross-functional projects; develops policies and procedures; and monitors emerging legislation and legal developments applicable to the company. The ideal candidate must be agile, responsive, solution-oriented and able to work effectively with a wide range of departments and personnel, both within and outside the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for contracting for AtriCure’s international subsidiaries, including, but not limited to, drafting and negotiating commercial agreements, agreements related to HCP engagement, and clinical trial agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advises the international Human Resources team on employment law matters throughout the EMEA and Asia Pacific regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists with managing employment-related claims and litigation, as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages legal support for day-to-day contracting needs, including template preparation and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Counsels internal clients throughout the contract lifecycle, including negotiation, contract management, and compliance; directly negotiates and drafts contracts on behalf of business units, including, but not limited to, commercial, clinical, regulatory, scientific, and medical affairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops policies and procedures related to the Legal Affairs Team’s scope of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Counsels senior managers and executives on legal matters, including employment and regulatory issues, changes in law affecting their areas of responsibility, and the intersection of legal developments with company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stays current on laws and regulations applicable to AtriCure and assigned business groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages outside counsel assigned to internal projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May manage departmental personnel, including attorneys and support staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May provide broad legal support to a specific business organization or group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ADDITIONAL ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS OF THE POSITION:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains regular and predictable work performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses sound judgment to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritizes duties and manages multiple responsibilities as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works collaboratively and effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (or equivalent) from an accredited institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;License to practice law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ten years of progressively responsible experience in a law firm or comparable corporate legal department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating complex contracts related to healthcare, research, or grant work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment while exercising sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and reprioritize duties, manage multiple tasks, and clearly communicate changes to affected stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, goal-oriented, self-motivated team player with a service-and-solution focused mindset and the ability to lead or follow as the situation requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft programs, including Outlook, Word, Excel, and PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, learn quickly, and take on new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 30%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the medical device, pharmaceutical, clinical research, or related industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on employment matters and managing employment-related litigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role can be based in the UK, Germany or The Netherlands, close to international airports to facilitate travel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€160.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€175.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure has a variety of benefits available for US based employees and their families. Examples include Medical &amp;amp; Dental beginning day 1 of employment, 401K plus match, 30 days of paid Parental Leave, in addition to maternity leave, for new moms and dads, Volunteer Time off, Pet Insurance, and more. Corporate-based employees also have full access to our on-site fitness center and cafeteria. To see a complete list of our benefits, please visit our careers website:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&quot;&gt;https://www.atricure.com/careers-atricure/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AtriCure participates in the federal E-Verify program to confirm the identity of and employment authorization of all newly hired employees. For further information about the E-Verify program, please click here https://www.e-verify.gov AtriCure is an Equal Employment Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer and provides Drug Free Workplaces. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national or ethnic origin, age, protected veteran status, status as an individual with disability, sexual orientation, gender identity or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local law(s).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You may access our global privacy policy here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.atricure.com/privacy&quot;&gt;https://www.atricure.com/privacy&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Coursera + Udemy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coursera and Udemy are now one company, bringing together two mission-driven brands to create the world’s most powerful platform for turning learning into progress. Together, we help more than 300 million learners and 12,000+ enterprise customers build the skills they need for a world being reshaped by AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us now?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming how people learn, work, and grow, and the need for new skills has never been greater. Coursera brings trusted content and credentials from leading university and industry partners, while Udemy brings a dynamic skills marketplace and global network of real-world experts. By combining these strengths, we can connect more people and organizations to the skills they need, when they need them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape what comes next&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our team, you’ll have the opportunity to reshape how the world learns and applies skills—and help millions of people participate in the new economy. Bring your ideas, expertise, and perspective to meaningful work that can make a difference at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Udemy is a global company headquartered in San Francisco, with additional U.S. offices in Denver and Austin, and international hubs in Australia, India, Ireland, Mexico, and Türkiye.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior in-house legal role for a commercially driven lawyer ready to take commercial legal programs work with partners and negotiate technology deals. The role reports directly to the Head of Commercial Legal, Strategic Growth.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We operate a hybrid go-to-market model that combines demand-led direct sales, solution-led growth, and indirect distribution through a tiered partner and channel ecosystem. We reach organizations globally through technology alliances, GSI relationships, channel partners, and reseller arrangements — powering learning and capability-building at scale. Legal sits at the center of all three motions.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;You will be a dedicated legal partner for B2B Enterprise, Technology Alliances, and Channel and Distribution Partnerships, supporting the development and negotiation of the indirect partner ecosystem that underpins our scalable distribution. This is a role for someone who combines deep transactional expertise with strong business instincts, operates with a high degree of independence, and is ready to grow into broader leadership responsibility within a scaling legal function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About your skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional business judgement and a proven ability to balance legal risk with commercial objectives in fast-moving deal environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive-level communication skills: able to distill complex issues into clear, actionable guidance and influence stakeholders from SMB to large enterprise and C-suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of using approved AI tools to increase legal productivity, and staying current on AI governance obligations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B Enterprise, Ecosystems and Technology Transactions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take primary ownership of drafting, reviewing, and negotiating complex commercial agreements across global system integrator arrangements, channel partner and reseller agreements, technology alliance and co-sell agreements, enterprise SaaS and platform licensing, API and technical integration agreements, and distribution and go-to-market partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise senior business stakeholders, including GTM leadership, and Product teams, on deal structuring, risk allocation, commercial terms, and multi-jurisdictional GTM considerations, serving as the day-to-day legal lead who positions Legal as a genuine business enabler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with the Product Legal team to develop and refine legal frameworks that support a self-serve and low-touch commercial motion, including API access agreements, developer terms, usage-based licensing structures, and SMB onboarding frameworks, contributing to a standardized, scalable approach that enables businesses to engage and onboard with speed and minimal friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide clear, solution-focused guidance on AI-related commercial arrangements, data-sharing agreements, and emerging technology implementations as they enter the enterprise deal mix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and continuously develop the suite of enterprise and channel contracting templates, playbooks, negotiation guidelines, and approval frameworks used across the partnerships function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design scalable legal infrastructure that empowers fast-moving deal teams to execute efficiently while maintaining sound risk controls across both direct and indirect channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Product Commercialisation and Third-Party Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a primary legal partner for the commercialisation of GTM products, advising on go-to-market structures, route-to-market models, pricing and packaging frameworks, and the legal terms that govern how products are brought to market directly and through third parties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Draft and negotiate agreements that govern the embedding, bundling, or distribution of our products within third-party platforms, marketplaces, and ecosystems, including white-label arrangements, OEM agreements, co-branded offerings, and platform integration terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on licensing boundaries and revenue-sharing constructs as the product suite evolves and is commercialised through an expanding range of direct and indirect channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Product, Product Legal, Marketing, and Sales to ensure commercial and legal structures keep pace with product development and new route-to-market initiatives, flagging and resolving legal considerations early in the product lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genuinely commercial in your approach: able to identify and manage risk pragmatically, find workable solutions under pressure, and avoid being a blocker to growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An effective communicator and influencer, comfortable advising and challenging senior stakeholders across Sales, Product, and Executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualified lawyer with 10+ years of post-qualification experience, including meaningful in-house tenure at a technology, SaaS, or enterprise software company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven track record negotiating complex B2B technology agreements including GSI, channel, reseller, alliance, and enterprise platform deals, ideally within or alongside global organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrable experience advising on product commercialisation, route-to-market strategy, or third-party distribution and embedding arrangements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable operating across both high-touch enterprise deals and high-volume standardised indirect channel frameworks, understanding that each requires a different legal posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly organised and self-directed, with a demonstrated ability to manage a high-volume deal workload across competing priorities and deadlines with minimal supervision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative team player who understands their place in a broader legal function and actively supports those around them, including upward to leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Date: &lt;/strong&gt;15 September 2026&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window: 2 weeks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We anticipate the application window will be open until 30 September 2026. Based on business needs, this opportunity may remain posted beyond or closed before the anticipated application window.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-ST5&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll grow here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Learning is part of the job. You’ll get full access to Udemy courses, a monthly UDay to invest in yourself, and a budget to spend on whatever helps you improve. Many people are diving into AI lately, but what you focus on is up to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI is real here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We use it in the way we learn and the way we work. You’ll have the space and tools to experiment, apply, and get better at using AI in practical ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll own your work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We trust people to lead, make decisions, and follow through. You don’t need to wait for permission or layers of approval to have an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll build with others.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We collaborate openly and shape ideas together. Everyone has a voice, and good thinking is welcomed from any direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll see your impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What you build helps people grow their skills, change their careers, or find a path forward. You’ve got the experience, why not use it to help others gain theirs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your curiosity. We’ll bring the platform and the support. Let’s &lt;strong&gt;LEARN&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits Start with U&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits start with you and were built to provide you and your family with the protection and care you need, making it easy to access the right coverage when you need it most. Benefits vary by region, and we encourage applicants to review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/au/au-home&quot;&gt;Australia Benefits, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/in/in-home&quot;&gt;India Benefits,&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/ie/ie-home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Ireland Benefits,&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/mx/home&quot;&gt;Mexico Benefits&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/tr/home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Turkiye Benefits&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/us/home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;US Benefits,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;pages to get an understanding of some of the benefits we offer. For details on region-specific benefits, please refer to the information provided during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits outlined are provided as a general overview and may vary depending on the location, role, and employment classification. All benefits are subject to change at the discretion of the organization and in accordance with applicable laws and policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Udemy, we value diversity and inclusion and consider qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, ancestry, age, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital or family status, veteran status, medical condition, or disability. We understand that not everyone will match each of the qualifications. However, we also realize that everyone has unique experiences that can add value to our company. Even if you think your background might not perfectly align, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To protect against recruitment fraud, Coursera + Udemy recruiters only communicate via official coursera.org/udemy.com email addresses and never through personal accounts. We do not accept resumes via email or social media; please submit all applications directly through our careers page. If you encounter suspicious recruitment activity, please report it via our&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/Mb8UktwuaJAukb3H7&quot;&gt; Fraudulent Activity Submission Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information regarding data privacy is available within the&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Coursera + Udemy Global Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on the lookout for a Senior Java Developer to join our Elasticsearch team and drive our work on the Inference API in Elasticsearch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Elasticsearch Inference API is the integration layer between Elasticsearch and external machine learning services including Elastic&#39;s own Elastic Inference Service (EIS), third-party providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, Cohere, Google), and self-hosted models. It powers features like semantic search, reranking, and generative AI across Elastic Cloud and in hosted environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll maintain and develop the plugin framework and REST API with your work spanning protocol design, streaming, async execution, billing integration, and with a tight collaboration with the wider inference team and the Kibana team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain integrations with internal systems and external inference providers, including schema negotiation, streaming (SSE), and error normalisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the inference plugin&#39;s internal architecture: task settings, chunking strategies, rate limiting, and provider-level configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review open source contributions to the codebase and work with third party engineers to ensure their contributions meet our technology standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation for inference-related incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write thorough tests: unit tests using ESTestCase, YAML-based REST integration tests, and rolling-upgrade tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of production Java experience, with experience contributing to a large, established Java codebase. You know core Java and are conversant in the standard library of data structures and concurrency constructs, as well as newer language features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience crafting ergonomic APIs and the ability to reason through tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with low-level Java such as concurrency, parallelism, classloaders, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of using AI to accelerate development, debug complex systems, and optimize code, while still owning the final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess the ability to collaborate across functions and teams and seamlessly transition between different projects, codebases, or teams based on business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work autonomously, drive decisions and results in a distributed team by leveraging asynchronous, direct, and transparent communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of JDK internals: modules, the Java memory model, garbage collection, database load, caching techniques, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to and ownership of open source projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Java build tools (Gradle, Maven, etc), with a strong preference for Gradle experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a platform team or developer productivity team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is looking for an exceptional delivery consulting leader — someone who has built and run international delivery organisations, understands how to drive bookings growth and revenue expansion inside complex enterprise accounts, and can operate at the highest levels of client engagement while simultaneously leading and transforming a mid-sized, globally distributed team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the international Delivery Management function across Elastic Professional Services — leading the team, driving the transformation, and acting as the senior client presence on our most strategic engagements. You will be accountable for both the operational health of the delivery organisation and the commercial outcomes it generates: bookings, revenue, and margin across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Delivery excellence is your foundation. Commercial growth is your north star. Building the team that industrialises both — and equips it for an AI-enabled future — is your legacy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Delivery Organisation — EMEA &amp;amp; APJ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own and lead the international Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; a team of ~15 Delivery Managers today, distributed across global delivery hubs in EMEA and APJ — with a clear mandate and expectation to scale substantially through 2027 and 2028 as the practice grows and demand accelerates across both regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Drive a team transformation &lt;/strong&gt;— reframing how Delivery Managers operate, shifting from project execution to outcome-led consulting, equipping the team to hold more strategic client conversations and drive greater account value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Champion and drive the adoption of Fixed Price engagement models&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; leading the organisation through the commercial, contractual, and delivery discipline required to scope, price, and execute fixed-price engagements with confidence, especially with platform migrations — protecting margin while driving predictable, high-quality client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a dual-mode delivery capability that operates with excellence across two distinct motions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Packaged Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; fast, repeatable, industrialised delivery of high-value outcome-based offerings at scale — anchored in Fixed Price commercial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Transformative Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; large, complex migrations and solution delivery that require senior delivery governance, deep client partnership, and adaptive programme leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Lead the integration of AI into the Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; identifying and embedding AI-powered tools and practices that improve team productivity, sharpen delivery insight, and — critically — enrich the client experience by enabling more proactive, personalised, and higher-value engagement throughout the delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Design and embed delivery standards, frameworks, and tooling&lt;/strong&gt; — including AI-augmented capabilities — that enable the team to scale both delivery modes without sacrificing quality or client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Act as a player-coach&lt;/strong&gt; — maintaining direct governance oversight on the most complex or at-risk international engagements, intervening and course-correcting where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a coaching and development culture within the team&lt;/strong&gt; — raising the floor on delivery craft and the ceiling on consulting commerciality across every region working closely with the Regional Services Directors, to generate new opportunities on the back of outstanding delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Leadership &amp;amp; Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own financial accountability across the international delivery portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; driving consulting bookings growth from delivery, maximising revenue realisation from engagements, and actively improving delivery margin through disciplined engagement management, Fixed Price adoption, and commercial rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Grow the consulting footprint&lt;/strong&gt; within a portfolio of strategic enterprise accounts across EMEA and APJ, driving land-and-expand value outcomes in close partnership with regional Sales organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Build and sustain C-level and VP-level executive relationships&lt;/strong&gt; that extend beyond the project — becoming the trusted advisor clients return to for their most important decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop compelling value narratives&lt;/strong&gt; that articulate the value of engaging Elastic&#39;s consulting services, influencing renewal, expansion, and new commercial commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with Regional Services Directors on pipeline development&lt;/strong&gt; — acting as a senior consulting delivery voice in pre-sales conversations, solution framing, and commercial structuring including Fixed Price proposals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Organisational Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Serve as the connective tissue between Consulting, Sales, Customer Success, and Product when driving an engagement — ensuring a unified client experience and shared accountability for outcomes across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Contribute to the evolution of Elastic&#39;s delivery consulting go-to-market: methodology design, packaged solution development, delivery model innovation, AI-enabled tooling, and commercial frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Represent Elastic Professional Services at the senior leadership level — internally and externally — with the credibility and presence to influence how the organisation grows internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;International enterprise leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Proven track record building and leading delivery teams across EMEA and/or APJ. You understand how regional culture, client expectations, and hub-based delivery dynamics shape outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Fixed Price engagement expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed, sold, and delivered Fixed Price consulting engagements at scale. You understand the scoping rigour, risk management, and delivery discipline required to make this model work — and you have driven its adoption across a delivery organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Financial accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have owned a P&amp;amp;L or delivery portfolio with direct accountability for bookings, revenue, and margin — and you have a track record of improving all three.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Dual-mode delivery experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed and operated delivery models that handle both high-velocity repeatable engagements and complex, multi-stakeholder transformations — simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;AI fluency in a delivery context&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have a clear point of view on how AI can transform delivery management and client engagement — and you have practical experience applying AI tools to improve team effectiveness, delivery quality, or customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have expanded client accounts, shaped SOWs, and driven revenue growth from within a delivery or consulting organisation. You know how value conversations are won.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Executive presence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You are credible at the C-suite level across multiple geographies. You have built relationships that outlast individual projects and turned delivery success into long-term strategic partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;People leadership at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have led and transformed mid-to-large delivery teams, building coaching cultures that raise performance and commerciality across a distributed, multi-timezone workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;12+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; in management consulting, professional services, or enterprise SaaS delivery leadership — with meaningful time spent in both client-facing growth roles and people/org leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience industrialising packaged service offerings — creating repeatable, Fixed Price delivery motions from complex, bespoke prior engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Hands-on experience deploying AI tools within a professional services or consulting delivery environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Background spanning pre-sales/solutioning and post-sales delivery — the full consulting lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience with enterprise SaaS platforms (e.g. Elastic, Salesforce, ServiceNow, Databricks) in a consulting or professional services capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Agile and hybrid delivery framework fluency in complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise environments, but with extensive experience of platform migrations / tools consolidation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Certifications (PMP, CSM, or equivalent) are valued, though leadership track record and client outcomes matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic&#39;s Professional Services organisation is at an inflection point internationally. We are scaling a delivery team across EMEA and APJ — with significant headcount growth expected through 2027 and 2028 — building a dual-mode delivery capability, shifting to Fixed Price engagement models, embedding AI into how we deliver and engage clients, and growing a client base that demands senior, outcome-focused leadership. All at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries real financial weight and a real transformation mandate. You will have the authority to reshape how an international team operates, the commercial platform to build lasting client partnerships across two major regions, and the executive visibility to influence how Elastic goes to market with its consulting capability globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have built delivery organisations, owned the numbers, led through transformation, embraced AI as a genuine force multiplier, and made Fixed Price work where others haven&#39;t — and you are looking for a role where all of it matters — this is it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DO YOU WANT TO WORK FOR THE WORLD LEADER IN ELITE SPORTS PERFORMANCE ANALYTICS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a world leader in sports performance technology, serving over 5,000 teams across 40 sports. We improve many of your favorite athletes&#39; performances with our wearable tracking technology, video and data analysis systems, and athlete management products. Our technology offers objective solutions to sport-based challenges and can be found throughout the NFL, NHL, NBA, AFL, NRL, Premier League, Bundesliga, La Liga and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Motorsport, Catapult’s SBG race management and team strategy systems are the technology of choice for elite-level organisers and competitors around the world, including in Formula 1, Formula E, IndyCar, NASCAR, WEC/Le Mans and other worldwide endurance racing. Customers include the FIA, nine Formula 1 teams - including the 8-time World Champion Mercedes AMG Petronas F1 Team - the majority of Formula E teams, the winners of multiple Le Mans 24-hour races over the last 10 years - Audi, Porsche, and Toyota - and teams and organisers in both IndyCar and NASCAR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have major offices in the UK (London and Leeds), USA (Boston) and Australia (Melbourne) as well as multiple smaller offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SPORTS AND WANT TO WIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented and enthusiastic &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to grow our Motorsport development team as we expand our RaceWatch products into new series and tackle new challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Based in the London office (3 days a week), you will be a key player in developing new capabilities in RaceWatch, focussing on one or two racing series, and also contributing to the entire RaceWatch suite.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe that our customers deserve the best platform, and we are on a mission to maximise and enhance their performance through delivering the highest quality experience. As a Software Engineer, you will help us drive our products and processes forward. You will be able to excel in a fast-paced environment with short project timelines from conception to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of our RaceWatch software for one or more motorsport series.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product managers and customers to design features and prioritise tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify ways to add innovative new features to the software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain efficient, reusable, and reliable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to code quality, organization, and best practices throughout the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and enhance software reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, or another scientific or technical subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for sport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years working in a fast-paced, technical environment, delivering software to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building applications in C/C++, or another object-oriented language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing products, scaling them, and supporting them throughout the entire lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for working with complex data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and an ability to communicate effectively with technical and non-technical staff, both internally and when speaking to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to go above and beyond for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to help cover live motorsport events at weekends on a rotational basis with the rest of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to multi-task and thrive in a dynamic work environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing Windows applications in Visual Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications that process video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing and project management platforms, such as JIRA or Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in motorsport is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We can promise you will work with some of the most ambitious and intelligent people in an exciting industry, and you will do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to have constructive, open and honest communication; to make Catapult extraordinary; innovate and create smart solutions; establish a collaborative, yet challenging, environment to develop our performance and the performance of our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries so you’ll have the opportunity to work across multiple nationalities and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to do things better. There is unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care about you. We offer outstanding paid maternity and paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams, organisations and competitors on the planet! While we have access to many exciting opportunities, we also realize that we are here to do a very important job for our customers. As a result, we aim to work with purpose and intention. We look for people that fit into our team culture, those who actively contribute and individuals who are excited about what they do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to build the future of sports performance, we need the brightest talent. If you think you can contribute to the empowering, enjoyable and exciting Catapult environment, then we invite you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SENIOR SOFTWARE ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to &lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,000+ teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SOLVING HARD PROBLEMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build the Perch camera system,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in London (hybrid), you will work across platform, perception, and ML systems. You will help us improve how we collect, process, and analyze performance data at scale, spanning from devices collecting real-time to backend services and ML infrastructure. All of which will have a direct impact on customers and their experiences with the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits a strong generalist who has seen many parts of engineering. You might have worked on any of the following: high-throughput systems, computer vision, robotics, ML infrastructure, or other complex applications. Our ideal candidate brings strong engineering judgment, good technical range, and the ability to learn quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be hands-on, working in Python and C++ on devices and services in use by our customers every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and implement algorithms for 3D object tracking, segmentation, and motion recognition on embedded hardware.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Train and iterate on ML models — from dataset curation through training, evaluation, and deployment to edge devices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help bring ML, computer vision, or signal-processing systems into production with tight performance constraints&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build reliable application features and services that customers use in real environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyze production data to find system limits, product issues, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate closely with the embedded platform team on model optimization and inference performance, and with the applications team on how tracking data becomes product features.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;4+ years of software engineering experience in production systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong skill in Python and backend engineering.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working knowledge of C++ or a strong reason to be effective in performance-critical code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience with data-intensive systems, distributed systems, parallel processing, or efficient data pipelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Exposure to ML, ML infrastructure, signal processing, real-time systems, computer vision, or related applied technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;A track record of shipping reliable software, not only prototypes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong debugging skills and the ability to find the root cause of complex system behavior.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Clear communication and good judgment when tradeoffs are not simple.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and the desire to learn new technical areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have — and what would make you exceptional:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with computer vision, depth cameras, pose estimation, tracking, or 3D data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML model deployment, feature pipelines, evaluation systems, or data quality tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming data, event systems, real-time processing, or low-latency applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with numerical methods, signal processing, filtering, state estimation, or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOUR SUCCESS WILL LOOK LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time, you understand the main systems, ship reliable changes, and help improve a meaningful data or product workflow. You give valuable technical input towards solving problems across backend, data, and perception systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months time, you have made a measurable impact on system reliability, product capability, or data quality. You own important parts of the architecture and help the team make better technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We promise you’ll work with some of the most ambitious,&amp;nbsp; intelligent people in an exciting industry, and do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to engage in constructive, open, and honest communication to make Catapult extraordinary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a collaborative yet challenging environment to consistently improve our performance, which in turn impacts our customers&#39; performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to work with people from multiple nationalities and cultures, and to build your global awareness.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to improve.&amp;nbsp; There is an unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams and athletes on the planet!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research shows that while men apply for jobs when they meet an average of 60% of the criteria, women and other marginalized groups tend only to apply when they check every box. So if you have what it takes, but don&#39;t meet every single point in our job ad, please still get in touch! We would love to have a chat and see if you could be a great addition to our team. We are building the future of sports performance. Our priority is to find the brightest talent who can add to our team culture, actively contribute, and be excited about what they do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starting Immediately&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to &lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,000+ teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Motorsport our customers include the FIA, NASCAR, INDYCAR, nine Formula 1 teams (including the 8-time World Champion Mercedes AMG Petronas F1 Team), 6 IndyCar teams, more than half of the Formula E teams, and multiple winners of the Le Mans 24-hour races.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SPORT AND BUILDING WORLD-CLASS SOFTWARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented and inquisitive&lt;strong&gt; Graduate&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;whose drive for learning and determination for continuous improvement aligns with our ambitious, fast-growing and transforming company. Based in London, you will be a leading player in planning, designing, building and testing the features of our motorsport applications. We believe that our customers deserve the best platform and we are on a mission to maximize and enhance their performance through delivering a high quality experience. Our software engineers match this ethos by taking responsibility for constantly improving productivity and are able to excel in a fast-paced environment with short project timelines from conception to deployment. This is a C++ role, however, if you have good knowledge of another object-oriented programming language (such as C# or Java), you will also be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Development: You will design and implement professional applications for elite-level motorsport using sound software engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance and Support: You will fix bugs and help our support team answer technical questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are expected to deliver on your goals in a timely manner and to provide regular progress updates to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation: You will assist with the production of documentation and the design of tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++ experience (or experience in another object-oriented language and a willingness to learn C++).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science or other scientific or technical subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing efficient data structures and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spoken and written English.&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for Motorsport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of UI and UX design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications on Windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of Agile development tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications in Visual Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications that process video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;\Basic understanding of networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOUR SUCCESS WILL LOOK LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time; you will be able to add new features to the software with guidance from the product and engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months time; you will have an area of speciality within the Motorsport team where you will be able to suggest new insights and solutions for future development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We promise you’ll work with some of the most ambitious,&amp;nbsp; intelligent people in an exciting industry, and do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to engage in constructive, open, and honest communication to make Catapult extraordinary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a collaborative yet challenging environment to consistently improve our performance, which in turn impacts our customers&#39; performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to work with people from multiple nationalities and cultures, and to build your global awareness.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to improve.&amp;nbsp; There is an unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams and athletes on the planet!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research shows that while men apply for jobs when they meet an average of 60% of the criteria, women and other marginalized groups tend only to apply when they check every box. So if you have what it takes, but don&#39;t meet every single point in our job ad, please still get in touch! We would love to have a chat and see if you could be a great addition to our team. We are building the future of sports performance. Our priority is to find the brightest talent who can add to our team culture, actively contribute, and be excited about what they do.&lt;/p&gt;
