&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help reduce Firefox’s WebCompat bug backlog by finishing or verifying the diagnosis of the long tail of site-breakage bugs, and by writing interventions or simple fixes (often with AI assistance). You turn a large queue of reported breakages into diagnosed, actionable, or fixed bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finish diagnosing, or verify the diagnosis of, long-tail WebCompat bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write WebCompat interventions where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write simple fixes (AI-assisted) and land them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reproduce and triage incoming site-breakage reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid web development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and comfort debugging real-world site breakage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluent with browser devtools and cross-browser diagnosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable using AI tooling to speed up diagnosis and fixes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Gecko knowledge is a strong plus (but can be taught).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior WebCompat or web-standards experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;Job Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ecosio is a fast-growing, innovative service company and a leading provider of B2B integration, specialising in electronic data interchange (EDI), Web EDI and e-invoicing. ecosio is part of Vertex, Inc., a leading global provider of indirect tax solutions listed on Nasdaq (VERX).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our brand slogan is &lt;em&gt;Connections That Work&lt;/em&gt; as we believe strong connections are central to successful business relationships - both external and internal. At ecosio, we hire individuals from all backgrounds and are committed to creating an inclusive work environment. We are technology lovers, set the highest standards for our solutions, and put innovative ideas first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll connect with the role if you enjoy...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;driving value for the company by successfully delivering on your revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically developing existing customers by establishing long-term business relationships and identifying opportunities for up- and cross-selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;managing your own portfolio of clients making sure they get the most value out of our solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;listening to your customers and communicating their feedback to ensure our products and services meet their needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;execution of sales campaigns in close cooperation with marketing &amp;amp; business development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To connect with ecosio it is important to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience in B2B SaaS sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills on a native / C2 level, fluent English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience working with a portfolio of existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience with cross- and up-selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And nice to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience selling EDI / e-invoicing / ERP solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By connecting with us you will experience...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our remote-first culture lets you work remotely from one of our designated countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit your schedule and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget to invest in conferences, courses, or career coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office allowance to create a workspace that fits your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular events and trips to connect, celebrate, and have fun with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workations of up to 90 days per year within the EU, combining travel and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing support, including mental health resources and employee assistance programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional country-specific benefits based on your location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sounds like a connection that works? &amp;nbsp;Then apply now and we will get in touch soon!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our hiring process at ecosio, we conduct standard background checks. You can find more information about them by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ecosio.com/en/background-check/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to build Connections That Work by fostering a diverse and inclusive team. We are committed to making everyone feel valued and empowered to contribute their unique skills, experiences and perspectives. And now we want to connect with you!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales Senior Finance Specialist to support our EMEA Sales organization.&lt;/strong&gt; This highly visible and commercially focused role will partner closely with &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales and Finance leadership&lt;/strong&gt; to provide value-added financial analysis, business intelligence, and strategic insights that support business performance and go-to-market decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will analyze &lt;strong&gt;pipeline, bookings, deals, customer buying patterns, expenses, and other leading performance indicators&lt;/strong&gt;, translating complex financial and operational data into clear, forward-looking narratives and forecasts. You will also partner with our &lt;strong&gt;Shared Services team&lt;/strong&gt; to strengthen financial models, analytics, and reporting while driving planning, expense management, process standardization, and automation as the business scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner closely with EMEA Sales leadership and the Deal Desk, providing financial and commercial analysis that supports deal decisions, go-to-market strategy, resource allocation, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Business Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;: Analyze business trends, customer buying patterns, pipeline, deals, and market performance to deliver actionable insights that inform go-to-market strategy and measure execution effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Modeling &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with the Shared Services team to build and maintain critical business and financial models covering headcount, expenses, commissions, pipeline, and bookings, translating complex information into clear, decision-ready insights for financial and non-financial stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate financial and operational performance into forward-looking narratives and forecasts aligned with underlying business and market insights. Drive financial planning, forecasting, and reporting activities, including &lt;strong&gt;Expense-to-Bookings (E:B)&lt;/strong&gt; reporting and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expense Management &amp;amp; Budget Control&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive expense management activities for EMEA Sales teams, monitoring performance against budget plans, identifying financial risks and opportunities, and supporting effective cost control and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide financial and analytical support to the &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Sales team and International Sales AVP&lt;/strong&gt; on strategic initiatives, special projects, and key business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive continuous process improvement by leveraging best practices, standardization, analytics, and automation to improve reporting, increase efficiency, and support business scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A or Commercial Finance roles, with experience building dashboards and supporting business decision-making through financial analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in financial analysis and modeling, with the ability to provide timely reporting and continue driving data analytics automation for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems experience with &lt;strong&gt;Tableau, Salesforce, Anaplan, NetSuite, Callidus&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar systems and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand the story behind the numbers and translate complex financial and operational data into clear, forward-looking insights, forecasts, and management-level narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly motivated, self-starting approach, with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced and ambiguous environment while managing multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, combined with the ability to synthesize large volumes of data into clear presentations and management-level views.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the &lt;strong&gt;technology industry or Sales Finance&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a collaborative approach and strong cross-functional partnership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree in &lt;strong&gt;Finance, Accounting, Economics&lt;/strong&gt;, or an equivalent field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CIMA Studier / Finalist&lt;/strong&gt; or progress toward a CIMA qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a problem solver, able to think outside the box and eager to nurture others and learn from them, then this is your challenge!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;principal engineer working across the entire frontend stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from design-system primitives to product-level architecture, you will shape how developers build with Algolia and how customers experience our products.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Frontend Experiences team, we&#39;re on a mission to make it effortless for developers to &lt;strong&gt;build great search and discovery experiences on the front end&lt;/strong&gt;, with libraries, components and tooling that are fast, accessible, and a pleasure to use. Our work reaches customers and their end users directly, on the web and on mobile, so the quality bar is high and the feedback loop is short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Right now, that includes a cross-team, multi-quarter effort to &lt;strong&gt;evolve the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; from a collection of product surfaces into one coherent environment: a new navigation and information architecture, a shared component foundation, and an interaction model that supports traditional configuration, conversational assistance and agentic workflows side by side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is looking for an experienced individual who is well versed in defining, building and operating scalable architectures, with proven strengths in cross-team collaboration, taking solutions all the way through delivery to adoption by other engineering teams and by customers. You will play a pivotal role in architecting and implementing systems that play a central role across all of Algolia&#39;s front-end products, including libraries that run in production on thousands of customer sites. You will also play a role in training/mentoring and leading team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defining the multi-year technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for Algolia&#39;s front-end platform, and turning it into roadmaps and projects that several teams can execute;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playing an active role in the evolution of the Algolia Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt;: shaping the experience architecture, the component strategy and the technical foundations for conversational and agentic UX, and partnering with engineering, product and design leadership to sequence delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving convergence on a shared component library&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing duplicated components and inconsistent patterns across product surfaces;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and delivering solutions&lt;/strong&gt; that will scale with significant volumes, be highly available, performant and resilient, including on pages and apps we do not control;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, taking them all the way through delivery to adoption by engineering teams and customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping API design, versioning and backward-compatibility strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for public libraries used by a large developer community;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embodying technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, that the team can refer to for advice or validation of a solution;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setting engineering standards and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; to be followed by engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of setting technical direction across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a &lt;strong&gt;thought leader/standard-bearer&lt;/strong&gt; for engineers, inside and outside the company (talks, open source, writing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;leading engineers on large, cross-cutting projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience &lt;strong&gt;designing full stack solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, interacting with microservice architectures, and strong grounding beyond the frontend (APIs, backend services, delivery infrastructure) to make sound end-to-end trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep frontend expertise&lt;/strong&gt; (TypeScript, modern web platform, React and other major frameworks, accessibility, bundle size and runtime performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;designing and maintaining public libraries, SDKs or design systems&lt;/strong&gt;, with a feel for API ergonomics and a track record of managing breaking changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;building complex, high traffic &amp;amp; multi products web applications&lt;/strong&gt; such as dashboards or admin consoles, and leading cross-team UI consolidation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in &lt;strong&gt;conversational and agentic interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; (chat, streaming responses, tool-driven workflows) and in the architecture needed to support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with search UX patterns and with generative AI and agentic experiences is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for candidates with experience at our current stage and beyond (over 10,000 customers, $50-200M ARR range, high growth, lots of change and building internal infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;uil-fw-normal uil-ff-hind uil-fsz-16 lg:uil-fsz-18 uil-lh-bigger uil-color-grey-700&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€135.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, AI Hunter, your job is simple: create new SingleStore customers. You will find companies building AI applications where data access, real-time context, memory, retrieval, or operational scale is becoming a constraint—and turn those challenges into new SingleStore customers. You will own a broad territory, build a majority self-sourced pipeline, create demand in an emerging category, and close greenfield enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunting role. You will engage customers before they have a defined project, develop customer-specific points of view, create urgency around business and technical problems, work with technical experts to land first production workloads, and build a measurable new-logo business with broad ownership. The ideal candidate is a measurable enterprise hunter who is competitive, curious, technically credible, resilient, and able to sell business outcomes. Direct AI sales experience is valuable, but proven selling ability and technical curiosity matter more than a narrow “AI seller” title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect fearlessly across a broad account universe using proactive, persistent outbound, account-based, partner, and market-education motions; stay resilient and effective through rejection and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form account hypotheses, map the buying center, and earn first meetings with relevant points of view tailored to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage executive, business, technical, security, and procurement stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead great business-first discovery, connect AI and data challenges to fundable goals, and build quantified ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop champions, multi-thread the buying group, earn executive and economic-buyer access, and maintain stakeholder alignment; own the stakeholder plan, mutual action plan, close plan, value case, stage gates, forecast, and commercial outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles through technical validation, security, legal, procurement, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions and Forward Deployment Engineers and cross-functional teams to validate technical fit and establish the first production workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competitive displacement and maintain disciplined activity management, CRM hygiene, reporting, qualification, forecasting, and opportunity management; showcase clear metrics such as pipeline created, meetings, conversion, quota attainment, and new-logo performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be AI fluent: use AI and research tools productively and responsibly while applying judgment, validating outputs, and separating facts from hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the assigned territory as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota-carrying B2B enterprise software sales experience, ideally selling to large or technically sophisticated organizations; experience in data, cloud, analytics, AI, or adjacent technical domains is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeated, quantified quota success with clear ownership of new-logo wins and self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving executives, technical evaluators, security, legal, finance, procurement, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell measurable business outcomes and build ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in an adjacent domain such as databases, data infrastructure, analytics, AI/ML, cloud, Kubernetes, developer tools, cybersecurity, observability, or open-source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong qualification, account planning, forecasting, CRM, negotiation, and deal-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning velocity and coachability, demonstrated through specific behavior change after feedback; ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence, customer trust, resilience, intellectual honesty, and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A., B.S. degree or equivalent in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Fortune 500 or security-sensitive organizations, cloud ecosystems, open-source or consumption-based products, or emerging categories is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and/or German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Charging your car should feel as natural as charging your phone. That’s the future we’re building: a network of EV chargers where life happens. We don’t just install chargers. We &lt;strong&gt;accelerate sustainable mobility.&lt;/strong&gt; We &lt;strong&gt;obsess over partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; We &lt;strong&gt;grow relentlessly&lt;/strong&gt;: our network, our partners, and ourselves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our mission is as simple as it is ambitious: &lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Sustainable Mobility&lt;/strong&gt; by investing in, installing, and operating EV charging stations through an innovative business model. We help businesses find the right charging solutions for their customers and make EV charging more accessible, reliable, and integrated into everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Partner Obsessed&lt;/strong&gt; 🤝 — creating tailor-made solutions that better serve our partners and their customers. We’re driven by the challenge of making EV charging simpler and more readily available 💡. And we’re committed to growing relentlessly 📈 — our network, our partners’ businesses, and the professional development of our team.&lt;br&gt;If you’re here, you’re probably not looking for “just a job.” Neither are we. 😎 We’re driven by impact and always looking for people who thrive on turning bold ideas into reality. If that sounds like you, you’ll feel at home here. We’re looking for people who see challenges as opportunities, thrive in fast-growing, high-energy environments, and want to shape the future of mobility, not just watch it unfold. At Powerdot, you’ll get &lt;strong&gt;freedom&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ownership&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;. The space to experiment. The chance to scale your ideas. And a team that’s always pushing the edge of what’s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About this Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Management Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll hold a key position within the Sales team, directly responsible for the Major Accounts scope — partners who manage multiple sites across their portfolio. You’ll operate at the centre of the electric mobility ecosystem, where technology, infrastructure, and a dynamic retail environment come together.&lt;br&gt;Your mission is to grow and protect Powerdot’s most valuable partner relationships by building long-term trust, monitoring account and station performance, and turning insights into actions that improve partner satisfaction and business results. You’ll act as the bridge between our major accounts and every internal team, ensuring that partner needs are understood, prioritised, and delivered — while continuously raising the quality of the partner experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Shape Our Story:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your day-to-day will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing and developing long-term relationships&lt;/strong&gt; with Powerdot’s major accounts and strategic partners, building trust and becoming their go-to contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring account performance&lt;/strong&gt; — tracking key metrics to identify opportunities to improve partner satisfaction, station performance, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preparing and leading quarterly business reviews&lt;/strong&gt; — analysing performance, extracting key insights, and building clear action plans to share with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acting as the main point of contact&lt;/strong&gt; for partners — understanding their needs and coordinating the appropriate internal teams to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Operations, Maintenance, Finance, Legal, Marketing, and other Powerdot teams to ensure smooth account management and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing and implementing partner-specific initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; — including promotional campaigns, special operations, and other commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring operational station performance&lt;/strong&gt; — proactively identifying issues, risks, and opportunities across the charging stations in your accounts’ portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translating partner feedback into action&lt;/strong&gt; — converting partner needs and business priorities into actionable recommendations for internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to process improvement&lt;/strong&gt; — helping continuously improve Powerdot’s strategic account management processes and overall partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Is About You, Not Us 🫵🏼:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1–2 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in strategy or consulting, ideally combined with experience in account management, business development, or a client-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt; — you can structure complex topics and turn insights into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/strong&gt; — you can interact confidently with senior clients and coordinate across multiple internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong business acumen&lt;/strong&gt; — you understand what drives partner value and commercial success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A customer-oriented mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you put the partner at the centre of your decisions and act on their behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities&lt;/strong&gt; — you thrive in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest in electric mobility, technology, and infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; — you’re curious about the evolving retail ecosystem and the future of mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ownership mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you take responsibility for outcomes and follow through from insight to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Kind of Energy We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;We’re not into titles, egos, or corporate buzzwords. We’re into people who make things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You lead and listen.&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust with senior partners while staying attuned to what internal teams need to deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You own your stuff.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t stop at identifying an opportunity: you turn it into an action plan and see it through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re commercially minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that great account management drives both partner satisfaction and sustainable business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You bring structure to complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You can manage multiple accounts, stakeholders, and priorities without losing sight of the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ve got a green heartbeat.&lt;/strong&gt; Sustainability isn’t just cool, it’s core. You care about building partnerships that make electric mobility more accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You balance rigour with relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re disciplined about analysis and follow-through, but you never lose the human touch with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You grow on purpose.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re eager to learn, deepen your commercial expertise, and help Powerdot strengthen its most strategic relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll be Powered up?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🏥 Private health insurance coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;💪🏼 Gym membership to support your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;⏰ Flexible working hours so you can manage your time effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🌍 Annual offsite to celebrate achievements and connect with colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🤝🏼 Regular team-building activities with your local team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;📚 English training to support collaboration across all markets and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🍩 Free office snacks, unlimited coffee, and meal allowance for every worked day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;⚡️ Special discounts for charging your electric vehicle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Promise To You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The best solutions come from different voices. We’re committed to building a culture where inclusion, respect, and equal opportunity are part of everyday life. At Powerdot, everyone is encouraged to contribute ideas, challenge assumptions, and create positive change.&lt;br&gt;Whether you’re strengthening a partner relationship, leading a quarterly review, or turning feedback into action, your contribution matters. At Powerdot, you’ll have the space to learn, take ownership, and help build partnerships that power the future of mobility. &lt;strong&gt;Your voice helps power the future — literally.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to the future of cloud networking and security!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the first company to converge enterprise networking and security into one centralized and global service that is delivered by cloud. It is led by networking and security pioneer Shlomo Kramer (Check Point, Imperva) and early investor (Palo Alto Networks, Exabeam, Trusteer and more). Cato’s unique technology inspired a brand-new product category, later named “SASE” by Gartner and a market expected to reach $28.5 billion by 2028.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is your opportunity to get on the rocket ship and join a company that is building a cutting-edge enterprise network and secure cloud platform, and is on a fast track to becoming the worldwide market leader – don’t miss it!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;We are looking for an intelligent and highly driven Senior Sales Professional to join our growing France Sales Team. In this role, you will be responsible for selling Cato’s solutions to prospective and existing customers across the French territory to Large Enterprise organisations. This is an opportunity to join a SASE Rocket Ship that is truly transforming Network and AI Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Building and maintaining a sales pipeline sufficient to achieve/exceed quota objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Proven ability to accurately forecast monthly and quarterly sales revenue, as well as, effectively run and manage all aspects of the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Developing your assigned territories and maintaining key relationships with existing and/or potential partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Conducting target account prospecting and sales calls/demos onsite and over the phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;7 to 10+ years of Field and Remote sales experience with consistent over-achievement of quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Prior experience selling Networking and/or Security solutions to C-Level and Technical Buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Track record of collaborating and demonstrated success in Sales Organisations that fostered teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Willingness to work very hard to make exceptional success happen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Experience in selling cloud based solutions - Advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;English and French language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JW1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Switzerland (remote)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;RVP Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: &lt;/strong&gt;within DACH&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;native/C2 level French and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quick Snapshot…..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of our revenue growth strategy, driving both new business acquisition and the expansion of existing enterprise accounts across key strategic industries in the DACH region. You will build trusted relationships with executive stakeholders, understand complex business challenges, and position Conga&#39;s enterprise-wide solutions to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Transformation Specialists, Customer Success, Professional Services, Partners, and clients, you will manage the full sales lifecycle from prospecting through close. This role is focused on 40% new business generation and 60% growth within existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why it&#39;s a big deal…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the opportunity to sell high-impact, mission-critical transformation initiatives that create substantial value for enterprise organizations. You will develop and execute territory, account, and opportunity plans, engage senior decision-makers, and lead complex sales cycles to drive predictable revenue growth within your assigned region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the person we are looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have at least 20 years of successful B2B enterprise technology sales experience within the SaaS industry and a strong track record of success in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a trusted advisor to enterprise customers, aligning business challenges with measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceeds quota within complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds and leverages executive, customer, partner, and ecosystem relationships to create, accelerate, and expand strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong knowledge of AI, automation, and revenue management trends, effectively translating these into customer value and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives predictable revenue growth through strategic account planning, executive engagement, and value-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mentality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a passion for identifying, pursuing, and winning new business opportunities. Through persistence, strategic thinking, and strong commercial acumen, you consistently create pipeline and close high-value enterprise deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Selling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take a consultative approach to understanding customer challenges, business priorities, and strategic objectives. You effectively position Conga&#39;s solutions and services, clearly articulating value and demonstrating how they help customers achieve their desired outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You proactively leverage available resources and take ownership of results. You are highly motivated, resilient, and committed to achieving success regardless of the challenges encountered along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can articulate complex technology concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences. You possess excellent listening, presentation, and negotiation skills, enabling you to address objections, build credibility, and influence stakeholders at every level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You embrace change and continuously adapt to evolving market conditions, customer priorities, and competitive dynamics. You are innovative in your approach and seek new ways to create value for customers and the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work effectively across cross-functional teams including Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Customer Success, Professional Services, and Partners to deliver exceptional customer outcomes. You have the leadership presence and influence to align stakeholders, mobilize resources, and drive successful business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will give you an edge...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling Revenue Lifecycle Management solutions with strong knowledge of CPQ, CLM, revenue optimization, document generation, and e-signature products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education and/or experience in Economics, Statistics, Mathematics, Accounting, Marketing, Finance, or Operations Research is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Did we pique your interest? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of job you would love in the kind of environment where you would thrive, please click apply. &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Resume Format&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We accept resumes in any format, we suggest using PDF or plain text. These formats help ensure that your resume’s formatting remains intact, making it easier for our recruiters to review your application promptly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t meet every requirement for the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and members of ethnic minorities are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single qualification. At Conga we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace, so if you’re excited about this role but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You just might be the right candidate for this or other roles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;st-additionalInformation&quot; class=&quot;job-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conga is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer and provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, age, national origin, disability, parental or pregnancy status, marriage and civil partnership, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. We understand interviewing can be stressful for those with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to allow you to show us your best self, please let your recruiter know as soon as possible. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines. Conga is not open to third party solicitation or resumes for our posted FTE positions. Resumes received from third party agencies that are unsolicited will be considered complimentary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;job-apply print-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&#39;s Applicant Privacy Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The information you provide during the application process will be used in accordance with Conga’s Applicant Privacy Statement (&lt;a href=&quot;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&quot;&gt;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&lt;/a&gt;). By submitting your application, you acknowledge and agree to the terms outlined in this privacy statement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The mission of Speechify is to make sure that reading is never a barrier to learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 50 million people use Speechify’s text-to-speech products to turn whatever they’re reading – PDFs, books, Google Docs, news articles, websites – into audio, so they can read faster, read more, and remember more. Speechify’s text-to-speech reading products include its iOS app, Android App, Mac App, Chrome Extension, and Web App. Google recently named Speechify the Chrome Extension of the Year and Apple named Speechify its Design award winner for inclusivity for 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, nearly 200 people around the globe work on Speechify in a 100% distributed setting – Speechify has no office. These include frontend and backend engineers, AI research scientists, and others from Amazon, Microsoft, and Google, leading PhD programs like Stanford, high growth startups like Stripe, Vercel, Bolt, and many founders of their own companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;With the growth of our Android app, being the most used text-to-speech app in the Play Store, we find the need for a Senior Android Engineer to help us support the new user base as well as work on new and exciting projects to push us forward. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a key role and ideal for someone who thinks strategically, enjoys fast-paced environments, passionate about making product decisions, and has experience building great user experiences that delight users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;We are a flat organization that allows anyone to become a leader by showing excellent technical skills and delivering results consistently and fast. Work ethic, solid communication skills, and obsession with winning are paramount.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Our interview process involves several technical interviews and we aim to complete them within 1 week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Yo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;u’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Owning major features and working closely with our design team - take ownership of features inside the app and become responsible of delivering high quality features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Shape the future of our Android team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Own, maintain and improve reliability metrics for key features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Participate in discussions across different teams - Product, Design, Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Review pull requests, and support other teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Handle critical issues or cope with unexpected challenges&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of feature releases and provide nightly builds for the QA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Ideal Candidate Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Android components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Experience building or contributing to at least one Android app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Product design intuition and user empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Drive to push the boundaries of Android UI/UX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Understanding of the importance of tests and how to approach writing tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Self-drive to improve the app and codebase above and beyond what&#39;s outlined in the spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Rock solid experience with Kotlin, Kotlin Coroutines, Kotlin Flow, Dagger 2, MVVM, Clean Architecture, Background Services, Music Player Service, Android Animations, Jetpack Navigation, JUnit tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;User oriented problem solving approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Driven with continuous feedback from leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Experience building, maintaining, or otherwise contributing to open source projects in Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Experience with iOS, Web or NodeJS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies we use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Kotlin Coroutines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Kotlin Flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Jetpack Navigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Dagger 2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Custom Views, Canvas &amp;amp; Paint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;Jetpack Compose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;JUnit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We offer&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast-growing environment where you can help shape the company and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial-minded team that supports risk, intuition, and hustle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-off management approach so you can focus and do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to make a big impact in a transformative industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salaries, a friendly and laid-back atmosphere, and a commitment to building a great asynchronous culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on a life-changing product that millions of people use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build products that directly impact and support people with learning differences like dyslexia, ADD, low vision, concussions, autism, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in one of the fastest growing sectors of tech, the intersection of artificial intelligence and audio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Switzerland Based &lt;/strong&gt;Salary range for this role is: 30,000-160,000 USD/Year + Bonus + Stock depending on experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think you’re a good fit for this job?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tell us more about yourself and why you&#39;re interested in the role when you apply. &lt;br&gt;And don’t forget to include links to your portfolio and LinkedIn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not looking but know someone who would make a great fit?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speechify is committed to a diverse and inclusive workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Speechify does not discriminate on the basis of race, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, or other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

