&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll join a newly formed team dedicated to building custom solutions that extend the Staffbase platform for our enterprise customers. We turn specific customer needs into reliable, scalable extensions — widgets, plugins, and integrations — that make our product work exactly the way each customer needs it to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Because the team is new, there’s real room to shape how we work: to set engineering standards, bring structure to our processes, and grow together. That’s where you come in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own the development of custom solutions end-to-end — from technical design through implementation, testing, and release&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with stakeholders (customers, consultants, and internal teams) to define and detail use cases before development, then validate solutions and gather feedback afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Build across the stack: customer-facing UI in React and TypeScript, backend services, and integrations with Staffbase and third-party APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor mid-level engineers and help bring structure, engineering standards, and good practices to a newly formed team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work in a cross-functional, agile setup and produce high-quality, well-tested code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Give and receive valuable feedback in our code review process, and continuously learn and share knowledge with your peers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work iteratively — pushing code frequently, keeping a healthy CI/CD pipeline, and automating where it helps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Solid professional experience (typically 5+ years) as a fullstack developer, including working within engineering teams and owning solutions from concept to delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong frontend skills with React.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript, paired with solid backend experience (e.g. Kotlin, Java, or Node.js)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Confidence working with REST APIs and SDKs, and integrating with external systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring or guiding less-experienced developers, and a knack for bringing structure to how a team works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort working directly with stakeholders — you can translate business needs into technical solutions and validate them afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A strong focus on quality, clean code, testing, and continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Fluent written and spoken English and German — both are required, as you’ll work closely with German-speaking stakeholders and customers in the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A self-starter who works well both independently and as part of a team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You understand and appreciate diversity and inclusivity in the workplace&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Go, MongoDB, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Terraform, Prometheus or Grafana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A background in professional services, consulting, or building custom, customer-facing solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Enterprise integration concepts such as SSO, SAML, OIDC, or SCIM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A good understanding of REST and microservices architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Supply Chain Specialist, you will be responsible for the end-to-end supply chain processes of Auterion products. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams and external partners, while providing the overall strategic and operational oversight necessary to ensure excellence across our global value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the planning, controlling, and optimization of supply chain processes, including procurement, logistics, warehousing, scheduling, and order management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate bottlenecks, redundancies, and inefficiencies across the supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary operational go-to person between purchasing, production planning, logistics, engineering and sales — ensuring information flows smoothly and handoffs are seamless&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, design, and implement improvements to supply chain processes and tools, including&amp;nbsp; ERP configuration, reporting enhancements, and workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document processes, develop standard operating procedures, and drive adoption&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and analyze reports, providing timely and accurate reporting on KPIs (e.g., delivery performance, inventory levels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively support daily operations and cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first point of escalation for supply disruptions, component shortages, and logistics failures — driving rapid, solution-oriented resolution with minimal business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily supply chain operations - ensuring purchase orders, shipments, and inventory movements are executed on time and in full&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain contingency plans and alternative sourcing strategies for critical components and high-risk supply categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with freight forwarders, customs brokers, and other partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional experience in a supply chain-related role (e.g., logistics, planning, procurement, customer service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on mentality – willing to support operational tasks as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of flexibility, motivation, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident use of Google Workspace (Gsuite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems, ideally NetSuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid Excel skills and quick understanding of digital tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and German (spoken and written) is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a structured and proactive working style and strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU Citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As Supply Chain Manager, you will own, drive, and lead the end-to-end supply chain for Auterion products. This is a hands-on leadership role combining operational execution, people leadership, and strategic development of a resilient, scalable, and efficient supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead and develop the supply chain team while working closely with Engineering, Procurement, Production, Logistics, Sales, Finance, and external partners. You will be the central point of ownership for supply chain performance, proactively identifying risks, solving issues, and driving improvements that support business growth and customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end supply chain for Auterion products, including supply planning, production scheduling, logistics, inventory, and order fulfilment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and grow the supply chain team, setting clear priorities, accountability, and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive day-to-day execution and supply availability, ensuring materials, production requirements, shipments, inventory, and customer orders are managed accurately and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of escalation for supply disruptions, shortages, production constraints, and other supply chain risks, driving hands-on resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, suppliers, and logistics partners to improve delivery performance, lead times, reliability, capacity, quality, and resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement across supply chain processes, systems, data, and ways of working, including ERP and NetSuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and monitor supply chain KPIs, using data to identify issues, drive corrective action, and provide clear recommendations to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable processes and operating models, including SOPs, planning processes, and best practices to support business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives including new product introductions, engineering changes, supplier transitions, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop supply chain strategy and resilience, including contingency planning, alternative sourcing, and critical-component strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continued growth of the function through hiring, coaching, capability development, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in supply chain, procurement, logistics, planning, operations, or a related field, ideally in technology, hardware, aerospace, robotics, or manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning and improving end-to-end supply chain processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, mentoring, or developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply planning, procurement, inventory, production planning, logistics, and fulfilment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage risks, disruptions, shortages, and escalations in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and data-driven decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems, ideally NetSuite, and strong Excel/spreadsheet skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and tracking KPIs and operational performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and process improvement skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills across technical, operational, commercial, and leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, pragmatic, proactive, and comfortable with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident user of Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Chief of Staff is part of the senior leadership team of the Vinted-wide Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics function. Your primary role will be to build an aligned, engaged, and impactful team while ensuring the successful management and execution of key data strategies and initiatives. The Chief of Staff reports directly to the Vice President of Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics (“VP of DSA”) and acts as a trusted advisor and partner in ensuring that the department runs smoothly, efficiently, and effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fixed-term (maternity cover) position for approximately 1 year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to the VP of DSA, providing advice and guidance on all matters within the function (e.g. operating cadence, planning, problem analysis, communication).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and run the function’s reporting cycles end-to-end (e.g. QBRs, OKR meetings, DSA All Hands); including content creation, preparation, facilitation, and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for coordinating the development and driving the execution of key function strategies and initiatives&amp;nbsp; (e.g. data related initiatives that drive long-term impact), and supporting broader cross-functional and organisational initiatives that involve DSA (e.g. reorganisations and operating model shifts).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and manage recurrent DSA operations (e.g. DSA’s onboarding programme as well as the Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics Academy programme).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of key functional events, including planning groups and agenda development (e.g. offsites, function week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for maintaining an efficient operating model by ensuring processes, policies, and ceremonies are in place and effective, fostering an aligned, engaged, and impactful team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the DSA leadership team on the integration of AI into our data team’s (300+ team members) workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the driving force behind the senior and extended DSA leadership teams; coordinating and managing meetings, keeping track of decisions and pending relevant actions, holding the group accountable, and ensuring follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Co-) author key documents on function-related topics, ranging from vision and strategy papers to process and standards documentation, based on high-level instructions and discussions with the team and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research and analysis on industry trends, best practices, and emerging technologies related to the function, and provide recommendations to the DSA leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the organisation and documentation of the function’s governance (e.g., Google Groups, Drive, Confluence spaces, Slack Channels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in strategy, consulting, or strategic transformation roles, with a track record of success in project management, management engagement, and strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to break complex initiatives and challenges into manageable deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects and initiatives simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership and interpersonal skills, with the ability to work collaboratively and build relationships across all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation and moderation skills, with experience designing and leading workshops to discuss strategic priorities, build alignment, and drive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable interpreting aggregate (analytical) data and turning it into actional conclusions –&amp;nbsp;but advanced data analysis skills are not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to effectively convey complex information to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on and detail-oriented problem solver, able to identify operational gaps and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and comfortable operating under ambiguity, with the ability to pivot quickly, reprioritise effectively, and respond to emerging challenges with a solutions-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€83.300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€112.700 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Senior Associate - Venture &amp;amp; Growth (m/f/d)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team rewriting the rules in private markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you’d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn Moonfare&#39;s access to the world&#39;s leading venture managers into a steady, well-underwritten flow of single-company investments our clients can actually buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A significant share of Moonfare&#39;s AuM sits in venture and growth, and the direct side of it, co-investments and secondaries in VC-backed companies, is where the business is growing fastest. Right now that dealflow arrives faster than we can review it, which puts the deployment of our proprietary funds at risk and caps how far the direct platform can scale. The scope of this role begins the moment an opportunity reaches us and ends when the deal closes, so operations sits outside it, as does the client raise itself. Your first year is weighted towards screening, pipeline and diligence, with the sourcing and business development side building from there as your market view and relationships deepen. You will work alongside senior members of the team rather than alone, and what moves forward is decided together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venture &amp;amp; Growth sits inside Moonfare&#39;s Investment team and runs two connected things. One is a multi-manager vehicle making primary fund investments into leading VC and growth managers across the US and Europe, where we have historically backed Founders Fund, a16z, Accel, Lightspeed, Khosla and General Catalyst. The other is the direct programme of co-investments and secondaries that those manager relationships generate, which is where this role&#39;s centre of gravity sits. You will report to the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and work daily with the commercial team, who depend on you for qualified dealflow, and alongside Legal and Operations to close deals and launch the SPVs we distribute on the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the direct deal pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Everything from the moment an opportunity reaches us through to close is yours to run, so nothing sits unscreened and no access window quietly closes while we are still deciding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Screen inbound co-investments and secondaries, and bring a view to the team. &lt;/strong&gt;You run the first pass on what reaches us and form a position on it. What progresses is decided together with the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and the wider team, so the value of your screen lies in the quality of the argument you bring to that conversation and in how sharply you separate the two or three worth our time from the rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run diligence on direct deals. &lt;/strong&gt;The core of it is judgement on the business itself: how good the company is, how strong the founding team is, how large and how contested the market is, and whether the thesis survives contact with the evidence. The technical layer sits underneath, with cap table analysis, preference stacks and waterfalls, and pricing and NAV work on secondary positions, so we know exactly what we are buying and at what price. You will do this with support from senior members of the team, and contribute to primary fund diligence alongside the direct mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Author the investment memos that go to IC. &lt;/strong&gt;The committee decides on what you put in front of it, so a memo with a gap in it, an inaccuracy, or a risk nobody spotted becomes a decision made on the wrong basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the market view, and then the market position. &lt;/strong&gt;Relationships with intermediaries, GPs and, over time, founders are what get us into constrained opportunities and keep us current on where secondaries are pricing. This part of the role grows as you do, and watching how competitors structure and go to market belongs to it, because that is what keeps us competitive on price.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the process repeatable. &lt;/strong&gt;You will refine how we diligence direct deals and contribute to the sourcing, screening and monitoring tooling behind it, including AI-enabled approaches, so the volume we can handle is not capped by how much a person can read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn deals into something our clients can buy. &lt;/strong&gt;The commercial team depends on this seat for qualified dealflow and for support packaging opportunities into investor-ready materials. Fund deployment runs at the pace this work sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Four or more years centred on venture and growth investing. &lt;/strong&gt;That comes along one of two paths. Either direct investment expertise, sourcing and diligencing investments in technology companies at a venture capital, growth equity or crossover fund, or an allocator seat focused on VC and growth where you have underwritten co-investments hands-on. Directly relevant adjacent backgrounds include TMT and technology investment banking, tech-focused private equity or software buyout, corporate development or corporate VC at a technology company, and consulting with a tech or commercial diligence focus. What matters most is a demonstrable track record of hands-on deal work: screening opportunities, running diligence, and taking a view through to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network in venture you can already use. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable. Relationships with GPs, intermediaries such as placement agents and bankers, and other LPs and co-investors, enough to get us access to constrained opportunities, support diligence and track spin-out candidates. You do not need the network of someone twice your experience. You do need a real one, and you will build a much larger one here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment judgement you can defend. &lt;/strong&gt;You form a view on a company and argue it, including the case against. You can read a business and a founding team, size a market and test a thesis against what the evidence actually supports. You are genuinely fluent in emerging technology and can develop conviction on themes and business models, with AI front of mind but not the only lens. You assess attractiveness quickly on limited or imperfect information, you are comfortable with financial modelling and market analysis, and you know your way around cap tables, preference stacks and waterfalls, secondary pricing, VC term sheets and SPV mechanics. You can hold several live opportunities at once and prioritise sharply between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial instinct, which matters here as much as the investing. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable too. This is a builder&#39;s seat as much as an investor&#39;s. You want a hand in structuring, go-to-market, process design and the operational scaffolding of a business line that is still being built. Your AI fluency goes past using the tools to designing processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication that works in three different rooms, and relationships that outlast any one deal. &lt;/strong&gt;You can pitch and tailor to an investment committee, to a commercial team, and to clients, and prepare the reports and presentations each of them needs. Just as important is what you build over time with GPs and intermediaries, the standing that makes them think of us when something scarce comes up, because that is what turns a contact list into access. Excellent written and spoken English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How the role is measured:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deals sourced, screened, and taken through to IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely deployment of Moonfare&#39;s proprietary funds, such as the Moonfare Technology Fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocation secured with GPs and intermediaries, meaning access we would not otherwise have had.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whether IC can decide on your memos without rework, and whether risks surface in diligence rather than after close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capital raised on direct deals and the performance ultimately generated. These are programme outcomes you contribute to rather than own alone, and they are read that way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By six months,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;the deal pipeline runs without the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing having to chase it. Opportunities are screened as they arrive, you are bringing a formed view on each one to the team, and the queue is visible to everyone who needs it.|&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By twelve months, &lt;/strong&gt;deal review is fully operationalised, with a process the team can run rather than one person&#39;s habits, and more than ten direct deals have been through IC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is unlikely to be a good match if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prefer to let relationships develop slowly and mostly in writing.&lt;/strong&gt; Much of our access comes from conversations with managers and intermediaries you do not know yet, and someone reserved about starting them will find the sourcing half of this job hard going.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want a defined process to work inside. &lt;/strong&gt;A good part of what this role runs does not exist yet, and you would be designing it while live deals are moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want sole authority over what you invest in.&lt;/strong&gt; We discuss deals as a team and decide together what progresses, which means your view gets argued with before it gets acted on. If you want to run your own book without that, this will frustrate you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your growth could look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next step from here is Associate Principal. Getting there means leading the majority of diligence processes rather than running them with support, and having a network that generates opportunities rather than one that keeps you informed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you get here that you would not get at a fund: you join the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing in GP conversations from early on and inherit access to a built-up base of manager relationships. You see the commercial side of raising capital for a deal alongside the investment side, which most investors never touch. And you help build a wider business, across a discretionary fund, capital raising for individual deals and, in time, a secondary market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you feel you do not meet all of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We can only accept applications from those eligible to live and work in&amp;nbsp;Berlin/London.&amp;nbsp;This is a hybrid role with office attendance required 4 days/week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that we do not accept applications sent by email. You should submit your application directly through our careers website.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact: You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment: We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We support your development with an individual growth budget of €1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Your Future: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your long-term financial goals with a company pension scheme, providing a 20% employer contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relax and Recharge: &lt;/strong&gt;You start with 25 vacation days and you’ll receive one additional day for each year of tenure, up to a maximum of 30 days. Moonfare gifts two days during our annual end of year company shutdown.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Lunch: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a free lunch every day that you are in the Berlin office, with a weekly changing menu that includes salads, curries, pastas, and a variety of vegan and vegetarian options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised Public Transport: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your commute with a monthly subsidy for the Deutschland job ticket, making your travel easier and more affordable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fitness and Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay active with a subsidised Urban Sports Club membership, giving you flexible access to a wide variety of sports and wellness activities across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Join a team of ambitious, smart, and committed professionals who are passionate about revolutionising private market investing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reward: &lt;/strong&gt;As a performance-first company, we reward strong performance twice a year, so your impact translates directly into how your pay grows - through potential base salary increases and/or bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our clients come first, Moonfare comes second, and we prioritise ourselves third - Client-Centric Focus. &lt;/strong&gt;Putting clients first means creating value for them is essential. Placing Moonfare second signifies that our individual professional future at Moonfare depends on the company&#39;s commercial success. Prioritising ourselves third reflects our humility in putting clients and Moonfare before personal interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We pursue excellence and honor our promises - Commitment to Excellence. &lt;/strong&gt;We hold ourselves to the highest standards, taking responsibility for our failures, and celebrating our successes. We commit to deadlines and stick to them and we learn from our mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are here to win and to celebrate our collective achievements - Win together. &lt;/strong&gt;We are mission-focused and think and act like owners. We exemplify the attitude we expect and each of us commits to do what it takes to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We foster personal growth but each of us earns our place as a Moonfarian through merit - Growth and Merit.&lt;/strong&gt; We hire, retain, and develop exceptional people and invest in empowering them to excel. We must all earn our place at the table every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand the important role that diversity plays in our success. Different backgrounds, experiences and ideas push us further and raise the bar. We’re committed to developing an inclusive and safe culture where everyone - regardless of colour, race, religion, sex, origin, sexuality, disability, marital status, citizenship or gender identity - knows that they are an integral part of the team and can bring their full potential to their work.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager (German Speaking)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Germany (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; German Speaking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven Senior Project Manager to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency. You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Client Delivery Excellence&lt;br&gt;● Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level&amp;nbsp;customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;br&gt;● Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear&amp;nbsp;success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution&amp;nbsp;adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;br&gt;● Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical&amp;nbsp;dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;br&gt;● Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer&amp;nbsp;executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-&amp;nbsp;party partners.&lt;br&gt;● Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&amp;amp;#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;br&gt;● Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;br&gt;● Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;● Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organisation.&lt;br&gt;● Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare&amp;nbsp;industries&lt;br&gt;● Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced technology environment.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in&amp;nbsp;ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;br&gt;● Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence,&amp;nbsp;Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;br&gt;● Fluent written and spoken German and English skill is a must.&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict&amp;nbsp;resolution skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;br&gt;● Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data&amp;nbsp;Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage,&amp;nbsp;Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;● Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin,&amp;nbsp;utilization, project profitability).&lt;br&gt;● Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers&amp;nbsp;and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled&amp;nbsp;product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address&amp;nbsp;complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members&amp;nbsp;to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Gigs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;227&quot;&gt;At Gigs, we&#39;re building the operating system for mobile services—a platform that lets tech companies embed global connectivity into their products effortlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Just as Stripe lets any business add a payment button in seconds, Gigs empowers platforms to weave in connectivity—bridging the traditional world of telecom with modern tech. From fintechs launching mobile services to HR platforms offering work phone plans, we automate provisioning and remove telecom complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot;&gt;Our team of around 150 people across the US and Europe, backed by nearly $100 million in funding from Ribbit Capital, Google, and Y Combinator. As one of the fastest-growing tech companies, bringing together early-stage engineers, product builders, and business athletes from companies like Stripe, Airbnb, and Shopify. We’re tackling deep technical and regulatory challenges to make connectivity truly seamless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;If you’re driven by curiosity, creativity, and the chance to shape the future of telecom, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things We Care About&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building in a highly complex space and tackling a massive problem. We want people who lean in when things get hard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed. &lt;/strong&gt;We move and we ship. We set bold deadlines and treat every week like it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see something broken, fix it. We don&#39;t wait for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsession&lt;/strong&gt;. Our customers&#39; product is our product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambiguity. &lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re building frontier technology in a complex domain. You&#39;ll need sound judgement and good instincts to make decisions without complete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First principles. &lt;/strong&gt;We don&#39;t ask how things have been done before. We ask why they were done that way at all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH is one of the most exciting European markets for Gigs. With world-class fintech infrastructure, highly digitised economies, strong telecom ecosystems, and some of Europe’s most sophisticated B2B buyers, the region is a natural fit for what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Go to Market (GTM) Lead to own our DACH strategy and execution end-to-end - from landing lighthouse customers and building operator partnerships to setting up and growing a high-performance regional team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary range: &lt;/strong&gt;€125,000 - €150,000 basic salary + sales commission plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;(The final offer depends on your background, skills, and how you perform through the process. We&#39;re open to considering outlier candidates, which may result in an adjustment to the scope and compensation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Work At Gigs&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gigs, we value in-person collaboration. We believe the best ideas, decisions, and relationships are built when teams spend meaningful time together, and our culture is designed around that belief. We support flexibility where it makes sense. Some focused work can be done remotely, and not every role or week looks the same. &lt;strong&gt;You should expect regular time in one of our&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;hubs&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as occasional travel for team workshops, customer meetings, and &lt;strong&gt;Gigs Republic, our bi-annual company off-site&lt;/strong&gt;. Our offices are designed to feel like home-inspired workspaces, with plants, thoughtful tools, and small, tight-knit teams that make collaboration feel natural, energizing, and effective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gigs, we believe in rewarding excellence. We offer competitive compensation and stock options because we see you as a true partner in our growth. We also provide stipends for your home office or work setup, a budget for learning and development to fuel your career, and of course, a free phone and international data plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our benefits, hubs, and what it’s like to work at Gigs? Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://gigs.com/careers&quot;&gt;Careers&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fin.ai/&quot;&gt;Fin&lt;/a&gt;, now part of Salesforce, is on a mission to help businesses provide perfect customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Agent Fin is the highest-performing AI Customer Agent on the market today, enabling businesses to deliver impeccable, always-on customer support across the customer journey, from service, to sales, to ecommerce. Powered by our own AI models, Fin resolves complex customer issues end-to-end across every channel, with minimal set-up and integration. Fin can also be combined with our natively integrated Intercom help desk, giving modern support teams one single system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with Salesforce, the #1 AI CRM, where humans with agents drive customer success, we&#39;re building the future of customer experience. Here, ambition meets action. Tech meets trust. And innovation isn&#39;t a buzzword, it&#39;s a way of life. The world of work as we know it is changing, and we&#39;re looking for Trailblazers who are passionate about bettering business and the world through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become an Engineering Manager for one of our teams in Berlin. You’ll lead a team of engineers working on products and systems that create meaningful impact for our customers and our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to lead an existing team, partner closely with product and design, and help raise the bar for high performance in how we work. You’ll bring clarity to complex problems, support your team to deliver great outcomes, and contribute to a healthy, inclusive engineering culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with engineering, product and design leaders to shape team direction and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating strategy into clear goals, priorities and measurable impact with the help of your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling your team to achieve high levels of productivity, performance, reliability and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching, mentoring, coaching and acting as a role model for engineers and other engineering managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating a collaborative, inclusive and supportive team culture focused on fast, focused, high-impact execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting effective planning, decision-making and communication across your team and wider engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to shape and evolve our engineering culture by contributing to engineering organisation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise that lists like this can sometimes appear to be strict requirements, but that’s not the case. Even if you feel you have a subset of the experience below, that’s ok—we’d love to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to lead engineering teams that deliver meaningful impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and supporting a team of engineers through personal growth and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of partnering with product and design leadership to deliver great outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated impact in a technical leadership or engineering management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and eagerness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to thrive in an ambiguous environment with a high degree of autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How will I be supported?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have a structured onboarding experience to help you get up to speed quickly in Berlin and across Intercom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have a close group of management peers to collaborate with and learn from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in our managers, supporting individual career development through training, coaching and regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have opportunities to contribute to and learn from our wider engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a well-treated bunch, with awesome benefits. If there’s something important to you that’s not on this list, talk to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and equity in a fast-growing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid way of working from our Berlin location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular compensation reviews—we reward great work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, wellbeing and insurance benefits designed for our employees in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-friendly leave and support in line with local requirements and company policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off so you can take a break when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A well-equipped Berlin office, including lunch and kitchen provisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A MacBook as standard, with flexibility to choose the equipment that helps you do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United States, compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, job level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. At Fin, we want to give people what they need to do the best work of their careers. Our benefits and programs are designed to support your health and wellbeing, your family, your time away from work, and your financial future. Offerings vary by location in line with local practices and requirements. Learn more about working at Fin and the benefits we offer at&lt;a href=&quot;http://fin.ai/careers&quot;&gt; fin.ai/careers&lt;/a&gt;. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring, Salesforce will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin has a hybrid working policy. We believe that working in person helps us stay connected, collaborate easier and create a great culture while still providing flexibility to work from home. We expect employees to be in the office at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a radically open and accepting culture at Fin. We avoid spending time on divisive subjects to foster a safe and cohesive work environment for everyone. As an organization, our policy is to not advocate on behalf of the company or our employees on any social or political topics out of our internal or external communications. We respect personal opinion and expression on these topics on personal social platforms on personal time, and do not challenge or confront anyone for their views on non-work related topics. Our goal is to focus on doing incredible work to achieve our goals and unite the company through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intercom.com/careers&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ever imagined saying, “I helped launch the future of transportation”?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rewriting the rules of urban mobility. At Vay, customers tap a button and a car arrives - with no one inside - powered by our world-first Remote Driving technology on real public streets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re live in Las Vegas and scaling fast, powered by a strategic investment of up to $410 million from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.grab.com/sg/&quot;&gt;Grab&lt;/a&gt;. Our mission is simple: replace private car ownership with a faster, cleaner, door-to-door mobility model. If you want to build something real, visible, and genuinely transformative, you’ll feel right at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious to experience Vay yourself? Use the code &lt;em data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;VAYCANDIDATE&lt;/em&gt; for $10 off your first trip in Las Vegas! Download the &quot;Vay&quot; app from the Apple or Google Play store &amp;amp; off you go!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s happening at Vay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First to roll out vehicles in both Europe and the USA on public roads without a human being inside &amp;amp; currently the 2nd largest commercial, driverless car fleet in the Western World.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;ve partnered with &lt;a href=&quot;https://kodiak.ai/&quot;&gt;Kodiak&lt;/a&gt; to bring remote-driving technology to autonomous trucks in the US, showcasing our ability to integrate our system into heavy-duty commercial vehicles and expand the applications of our tech across the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ve completed 10’s of thousands of trips so far and are busy multiplying our Las Vegas fleet just to meet demand!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;...And soon we’ll be expanding across the US &amp;amp; Europe 🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1563&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, Connectivity at Vay, you’ll help build and optimize the networking backbone that makes remote driving possible.&lt;/strong&gt; Our Connectivity team owns the low-latency real-time video streaming and data transport systems that connect our vehicles with our telestations across cellular and satellite networks. This is a hands-on engineering role where performance, reliability, and safety matter every day, and where your work will directly shape the quality of the remote driving experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1565&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;You’ll work on a latency-sensitive distributed system, test your solutions on state-of-the-art hardware, and use real production data to investigate incidents, improve performance, and keep pushing our network stack forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be driving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, optimize, and maintain high-performance network stack used to transport data (video, audio, control, telemetry) between the vehicle and the telestation with a strong emphasis on clarity, maintainability, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate the Vay network stack into various target hardware and software platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and maintain network testbeds and CI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile and optimize the performance of the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage incidents from the production system and create fixes/improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What are we looking for&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in modern C++ (C++17 or later), with a focus on high-performance, multi-threaded applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Linux-based environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of networking fundamentals and protocols (TCP, UDP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze and optimize systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a research-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good interpersonal and communication (oral and written) skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of networking and wireless technologies, including LTE/5G, WiFi, Starlink, and experience with tools like Wireshark for traffic analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with streaming protocols, such as RTP/RTCP/RTMP/SRT, and media frameworks, such as GStreamer, FFmpeg, or DirectShow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with congestion control algorithms and network simulation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building and deployment (e.g. CMake, Docker, Yocto), and scripting languages such as Python or Lua.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in real-time or embedded systems development, with knowledge of modem configuration via AT commands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in performance analysis and debugging, using tools like perf, perfetto; and graphical UIs like ImGui.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why choose Vay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪 A global team of smart, motivated people from 30+ countries who love tackling hard problems and turning bold ideas into reality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Huge scope for impact in a fast paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EIP stock options: A stake in Vay’s future - not just a salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Unlimited Paid Vacation Days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎫 Subsidised Deutschland ticket (Berlin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏋️‍♂️ Subsidised Urban Sports Club or FitX Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 All Vay team members receive 30% off their Vay rides&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛍️ Exclusive external discounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 €350 Home Office Set-up&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Relocation financial assistance when relocating to Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Fully funded German Lessons&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎊 Regular team events throughout the year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;For more information on Vay’s physical demands, working environments and safety requirements, you can review this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1swEohclBwsOgx37G4NHE2szYCA6avS_aQX_WSJ7Ih8k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.6dlrur2mwcd9&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;. We’ll also cover anything specific to this role during the first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We’d love to stay connected for future opportunities, so feel free to include your LinkedIn profile when you apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds and experiences. If you’re excited about shaping something truly groundbreaking, we’d be happy to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;job-modal__content-heading&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;section&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Concept &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mensch)&lt;/strong&gt; bist du unser kreativer Kopf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;und übernimmst die inhaltliche Führung bei der Erstellung von&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Konzepte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;und Kampagnen. Dabei greifst du auf&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;ein&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;spezifisches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fachwissen aus den&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;ereichen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Copywriting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;, Art&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;oder&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;epti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;on zurück.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW33926073 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Mission: Kreative Exzellenz!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Kreation&amp;nbsp;trifft&amp;nbsp;Media:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dein Fokus liegt auf der Entwicklung und Umsetzung kanalübergreifender Konzepte und kulturell relevanter Kampagnen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Diese erstellst du im Kontext der Mediaagentur passgenau mit Blick auf die Mediaplanung und stehst im engen Austausch mit deinen Kolleg:innen aus der Media.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;Interdisziplinäre Zusammenarbeit:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;Um effizienter und nachhaltiger an Projekten zu arbeiten, stimmst du dich regelmäßig mit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;Expert:i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;nnen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;aus anderen Fachabteilungen wie Brand Experience oder&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;Social&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt; Media ab.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW215874325 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;Konzeptionelle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;Führung:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;Innerhalb deiner Projekte übernimmst du die ganzheitliche konzeptionelle Führung – von der initialen Idee bis zur finalen Umsetzung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;und&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;sorgst&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;auf diesem Weg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;für&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Konsistenz und Exzellenz im Outpu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214142252 BCX8&quot;&gt;t.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; Teamwork:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;section&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Team-Spirit:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Darüber hinaus teilst du dein Wissen und deine Expertise proaktiv mit unseren aufstrebenden Talenten – von Mid-Level bis zu unseren Werkstudierenden – und trägst so maßgeblich zur Entwicklung unseres gesamten Kreativteams bei.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt;Kunden &amp;amp; Projekte:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du begleitest Projekte&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt;konzeptionell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt;, arbeitest eng mit dem Projektmanagement zusammen und präsentierst Ideen professionell vor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt;Kund:innen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW229180724 BCX8&quot;&gt; – auch bei Pitches und Reviews spielst du eine wichtige Rolle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation Lead:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du liebst neue Trends, setzt dich regelmäßig mit KI auseinander, und hast Lust, Neues auszuprobieren und zu etablieren.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist eigeninitiativ, verantwortungsbewusst, ein echter Teamplayer und arbeitest strukturiert, lösungsorientiert und mit hohem Qualitätsanspruch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Erfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideal sind 4-7 Jahre in Copywriting, Art Direction oder Konzeption, Markenführung. Kreatives Storytelling beherrschst du perfekt und du besitzt bereits routinierte Dreherfahrung.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Du präsentierst und argumentierst stark auf Deutsch (C1) und Englisch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; Zeig uns, was du&amp;nbsp;drauf hast&amp;nbsp;– besonders Kampagnen,&amp;nbsp;Social-Formate und KI-Projekte!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #kreativ #innovativ #teamplayer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten. #LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is the trusted source for open source. By delivering hardened, secure, and production-ready builds of all the open source software engineers and AI agents rely on, Chainguard helps organizations build faster, stay compliant, and eliminate risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our customers include Fortune 500 enterprises and global industry leaders, including Anduril, Canva, Fortinet, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, OpenAI, Snap Inc., and Snowflake. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chainguard is venture-backed by leading investors, including Amplify, IVP, Kleiner Perkins, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Mantis VC, Redpoint Ventures, Sequoia Capital, and Spark Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role, in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Customer Success Manager at Chainguard, you will be the post-sales primary point of contact for our customers. You will be responsible for taking lead on customer engagements across onboarding, implementation, and adoption. In this role, you will work closely with Solutions Architects, Technical Support, Product Management, Engineering and Sales to ensure the successful onboarding and support of your customers. You are their day-to-day contact, building relationships with customers and driving outcomes, adoption, and delivering time-to-value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success Planning &amp;amp; Value: Drive business success planning by partnering with customers, pre-sales, and post-sales teams to align on requirements, goals, and challenges. Provide thought leadership on change management for large, scaled rollouts. Support the full Business Value Realization cycle to ensure customers can demonstrate and prove value internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Advocacy: Act as the voice of the customer within the organization, advocating for customer needs and requirements to internal teams.&amp;nbsp; This means being a team player and having strong collaboration skills - this role must align with many different internal teams, influence them to act toward customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue Management: Collaborate with Technical Support and Customer Engineering teams to ensure timely resolution to customer issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Expertise: Develop hands-on technical knowledge of Chainguard and stay up-to-date with industry trends, new features, and best practices so you can help customers optimize their use of Chainguard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training &amp;amp; Education: Collaborate with customers and our Edu team to ensure customers are educated on product features, best practices, and security principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Management: Develop relationships with multiple levels of customer stakeholders from technicians to CISOs. Work closely with sales teams to identify the best path to renew and expand customers while minimizing churn risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in enterprise, customer facing roles collaborating with both technical and business teams - Customer Success, Professional Services, Technical Account Management or a combination of those plus Sales, Solutions Engineering, or Technical Support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant domain knowledge of one or more of the following: Supply Chain Security, DevSecOps, AppSec, security infrastructure, containers, regulatory compliance requirements, vulnerability management, software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a strategic and proactive role, our expectation is that this person will take full ownership of their customer portfolio and act with a high level of autonomy.&amp;nbsp; This includes making key decisions to drive effective customer outcomes; deciding when to include our executive team or c-suite in customer escalations, how to de-risk or de-escalate customer issues and conflict, and advocating to internal teams including sales, product, engineering, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset - you will be often build entirely new process or practices to ensure we best serve customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates a strong commitment to continuous personal and professional development, actively seeking opportunities to enhance skills, expand knowledge, and advance within their career and field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven, high emotional intelligence, and strong priority management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous early-stage startup experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology &amp;amp; cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant hands-on technical experience, in one or more of the following domains: cloud computing environments (AWS, GCP, Azure), containers, Linux, Supply Chain Security, DevSecOps, AppSec, security, security infrastructure, regulatory compliance requirements, vulnerability management, software development lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We live and breathe our company values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer obsessed — We focus on delivering solutions to our customers that create value and make their lives better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a bias for intentional action — We prioritize, plan, try things, and fail fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t take ourselves too seriously (but we do serious work) — We are solving an important problem which takes focus, but we also like to enjoy the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We trust each other and assume good intentions — We&#39;re transparent with decisions to empower team members to make well informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few of the benefits we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible &amp;amp; Remote-First Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work remotely with team meetup opportunities, bi-annual destination summits, and a monthly stipend for coworking spaces, phone and internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive stock options upon hire and promotion. Plus, you can participate in secondary offerings and have 10 years to exercise your options (yes, you read that correctly: 10 years!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100% Covered Health Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover 100% of your health, vision and dental insurance premiums for you and your dependents. Nothing comes out of your paycheck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∞ Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Take the time you need – to do our best work, we need to recharge and reset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;18 Weeks Paid Parental Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer 18 weeks for birthing parents and 12 weeks for non-birthing parents, with the option to use it all at once or throughout your child&#39;s first year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your experience is close but doesn&#39;t fulfill all requirements, please apply. We&#39;re building the best team in technology and are focused on hiring &quot;Chainguardians&quot; with unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Chainguard will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.chainguard.dev/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Chainguard&#39;s Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
